  "patches": [
    "Remove every System.out diagnostic in Spake2Context and GroupElement; erase temporary random private-key bytes.",
    "Correct Curve.fromBytesNegateVarTime sign-bit extraction for signed Java byte.",
    "Replace Ed25519FieldElement.multiply with CC0 EdDSA-Java signed-radix method from revision e0ac35769db8553fb714b09f0d3f3d2b001fd033; the fork's unsigned routine violates signed field-element invariants and failed independent scalar-multiply tests.",
    "Refactor Ed25519FieldElement multiply, square and squareAndDouble to accumulate the same signed-radix coefficients directly into ten long array limbs and share the unchanged twelve signed carries. Removes the Android 4.4 x86 Dalvik JIT virtual-register overflow without secret-dependent control flow or BigInteger production arithmetic. Added test-only fixed vectors and independent integer-oracle/boundary checks in core/src/test/java/io/github/muntashirakon/crypto/ed25519/FieldArithmeticTests.java."
  ]
